{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "00618c91-f39a-44ea-b9d8-175c996460dc"/*LoadGltfScene*/,
  "Description": "Loads a scene with meshes, materials, transforms, skeletons and animations from a glTF file.\n\nSupports .glb files as well as .gltf files with their .bin and texture files. Connect the ResultSetup output to [DrawScene] to render it. The Mesh and Material outputs provide a single child selected by MeshChildIndex, e.g. for [DrawMesh]. Rigged and animated models can be used with [SampleGltfAnimation], [PoseToSkinMatrices] and [SkinMesh].\n\nAKA: gltf, glb, model, import, scene\n\nSee also: [DrawScene], [LoadObj]\n\nAlso check out the [HowToDrawThings] tutorial.",
  "SymbolTags": "72",
  "InputUis": [
    {
